CLASS com/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/au com/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/Waypoint
	COMMENT A single queued order, reused through a pool. Fields: type (WaypointType), unitType (UnitTypeInterface, set for build orders), actionId (ActionId), buildTechLevel (the tech level to build the unit at; only set by setBuildTo and passed straight to tryBuildUnit and getSpecialAction), x/y (target position), unitId (deferred unit id, resolved by convertToUnitId via GameObject's id lookup), targetUnit (Unit), group (GroupControllerUnitGroup), formationFaceEnemy, automatic (marks a repair order the mover queued by itself when it passed a damaged ally; OrderableUnit pops such a waypoint again once the next waypoint is a guard/patrol or the queue is exhausted), addedByAction, repairReclaimRangePadding and maxWaypointDuration. Net (de)serialization is versioned: v40 buildTechLevel, v46 repairReclaimRangePadding/maxWaypointDuration, v58 automatic, v65 formationFaceEnemy, v79 addedByAction, v82 actionId. getDummyTargetUnit hands out the shared gray-team dummy for position-only orders; resetToMove resets to a plain move order. [behaviour verified]
	FIELD a type Lcom/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/av;
	FIELD b unitType Lcom/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/as;
	FIELD c actionId Lcom/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/a/c;
	FIELD d buildTechLevel I
	FIELD e x F
	FIELD f y F
	FIELD g unitId J
	FIELD h targetUnit Lcom/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/am;
	FIELD i group Lcom/corrodinggames/rts/gameFramework/ab;
	FIELD j formationFaceEnemy Z
	FIELD k repairReclaimRangePadding F
	FIELD l maxWaypointDuration F
	FIELD m automatic Z
	FIELD n addedByAction Z
	METHOD a getUnitType ()Lcom/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/as;
	METHOD a setMoveTo (FF)V
	METHOD a setBuildTo (FFLcom/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/as;I)V
	METHOD a setAttack (Lcom/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/am;)V
	METHOD a isRoughlySamePosition (Lcom/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/au;)Z
	METHOD a write (Lcom/corrodinggames/rts/gameFramework/j/as;)V
	METHOD a read (Lcom/corrodinggames/rts/gameFramework/j/k;)V
	METHOD b getBuildTechLevel ()I
	METHOD b setAttackMoveTo (FF)V
	METHOD b setRepair (Lcom/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/am;)V
	METHOD b matches (Lcom/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/au;)Z
	METHOD c convertUnitIds ()V
	METHOD c setPatrolTo (FF)V
	METHOD c setGuard (Lcom/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/am;)V
	METHOD c copyFrom (Lcom/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/au;)V
	METHOD d getType ()Lcom/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/av;
	METHOD d setTouchTarget (Lcom/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/am;)V
	METHOD e resetToMove ()V
	METHOD e setFollow (Lcom/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/am;)V
	METHOD f requiresTargetUnit ()Z
	METHOD f setReclaim (Lcom/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/am;)V
	METHOD g getTargetX ()F
	METHOD g setLoadInto (Lcom/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/am;)V
	METHOD h getTargetY ()F
	METHOD h setLoadUp (Lcom/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/am;)V
	METHOD i getTargetUnit ()Lcom/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/am;
	METHOD j getUnitId ()J
	METHOD k convertToUnitId ()V
	METHOD l getDummyTargetUnit ()Lcom/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/am;
